Delete Your Account
LeadLog CRM · Last updated: September 26, 2026

You can request permanent deletion of your LeadLog CRM account and all associated data at any time.

How to request deletion
Send an email to solgib@yahoo.com with the subject line "Account Deletion Request"
Include the email address associated with your LeadLog CRM account
We will confirm your identity and process the deletion within 30 days
What gets deleted
Deleting your account permanently removes:

Your account information (name, email, phone number, password)
All leads you have created
All customer records
All appointments
All sales records and sales-pitch notes
Your app preferences (theme, language)
This action is permanent. Once your data is deleted, it cannot be recovered.
Data we may retain
We do not retain any personal data after account deletion, except where retention is required to comply with legal obligations.

